			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]王子『ああっ！
それだけは　やめろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="sato_hitomi:W00231"
				Time="2011-10-28T11:05:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
